# The repo-root pattern `egs*/*/*/data*` (meant for recipe data dirs) also
# matches this recipe's dataset/ PACKAGE, silently ignoring any new source
# file under it.  Un-ignore the package; the run-time dirs (data/, downloads/,
# exp/) stay covered by the root patterns.
!dataset/

# README.md's anchor-mode recipe (gt/resynth) sed-generates mode-edited
# copies of conf/inference_conversational.yaml and conf/metrics.yaml here.
# They must stay under conf/ (espnet3's config loader infers the recipe's
# default package from a .../conf/... path segment), but must never be
# committed -- this directory holds only that generated, disposable output.
conf/generated/
